{"id":"62ba454c37d12a16","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-modal-letterless-truth.md","title":"Self-Referential Truth of Letterless Modal Sentences","display":"df-modal-letterless-truth — Self-Referential Truth of Letterless Modal Sentences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-modal-letterless-truth","aliases":["92-df-modal-letterless-truth"],"display":"df-modal-letterless-truth — Self-Referential Truth of Letterless Modal Sentences","source":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-associated-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-modal-letterless-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-modal-letterless-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-letterless-truth — Self-Referential Truth of Letterless Modal Sentences"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f403c224ddb070f8\" href=\"?note=f403c224ddb070f8\" title=\"92-df-modal-associated-system\">92-df-modal-associated-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\">\\(U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_U^0,T_U^0\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_U^0,T_U^0\\)</span> 为下文的真值谓词与真值集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(\\bot)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(0=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X\\supset Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_U^0(Y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(\\Box X)&amp;\\leftrightarrow (U\\vdash X),\\\\\nT_U^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}:\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(\\bot)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(0=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X\\supset Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_U^0(Y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(\\Box X)&amp;\\leftrightarrow (U\\vdash X),\\\\\nT_U^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}:\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>首行右侧是在元语言自然数中假的等式。Box 分支询问已经固定的句法可证集合，不调用 X 的真值，故结构递归良基。这与 Kripke 满足关系、算术真值是不同解释。</p>\n<p>含命题变量时需另给赋值；原书只为 letterless sentences 定义。T_U^0 是 M^0(U) 的 truth set：估值条件及 Box iff 可证条件均成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-associated-system","status":"resolved","id":"f403c224ddb070f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-associated-system]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_U^0,T_U^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(\\bot)&\\leftrightarrow(0=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X\\supset Y)&\\leftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_U^0(Y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_U^0(\\Box X)&\\leftrightarrow (U\\vdash X),\\\\\nT_U^0&\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}:\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1477,"backlinks":[{"id":"7d011f131f5a8d4d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]] → [[92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness]] → [[92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness]] → [[92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability]]。"},{"id":"1f1a5dcc2c5a5996","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]]"}],"outgoing":["f403c224ddb070f8"]}